  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Finale du projet regional PREVENIR(Prevention et Resilience pour l&apos;Avenir)-2021-2025, mise en oeuvre par DRC dans la region Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the ToR, an independent evaluation of the PREVENIR programme  (01 November 2021- 31 july 2025  is requested by the Dutch Embassy in Senegal. Based on the OECD criteria, the evaluation  will provide information on the relevance of the theory of change and the regional approach adopted, as well as the effectiveness of interventions within a constantly changing context(Knowledge objective). It is also provide strategic guidance for a possible new phase of the project, funded by Dutch embassy.</narrative>
  </description>
